It is taking advantage of the fact that black puddings will split
themselves an infinite number of times with the right motivation. An
infinite number of puddings means an infinite number of death drops from
those puddings. Black pudding corpses are also valued enough to be very
effective at mollifying your god following prayer, so you can sacrifice
tons of them for artifacts, and pray for tons of spellbooks and intrinsic
protection.




